{"path":"keyword/struct","title":"C++ keyword: struct","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">C++ keyword:</span><code>struct</code>","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/keyword/struct","section":"keyword","kind":"page","summary":"","html":"<h3 id=\"Usage\">Usage</h3>\n<ul><li> <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/class\">declaration of a compound type</a>\n</li></ul>\n<table class=\"t-rev-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-rev t-since-cxx11\"><td>\n<ul><li> <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/enum\">declaration of a scoped enumeration type</a>\n</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span></td></tr>\n</table>\n<ul><li> If a function or a variable exists in scope with the name identical to the name of a non-union class type, <code>struct</code> can be prepended to the name for disambiguation, resulting in an <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/elaborated_type_specifier\">elaborated type specifier</a>.\n</li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"kw1\">struct</span> Foo<span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// forward declaration of a struct</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw1\">struct</span> Bar  <span class=\"co1\">// definition of a struct</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    Bar<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span> i<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> i<span class=\"br0\">(</span>i <span class=\"sy2\">+</span> i<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> i<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw2\">enum</span> <span class=\"kw1\">struct</span> Pub <span class=\"co1\">// scoped enum, since C++11</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    b, d, p, q,\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    Bar Bar<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">struct</span> Bar Bar2<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">2</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// elaborated type</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<ul><li> <a href=\"/w/cpp/keyword/class\"><code>class</code></a>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/keyword/union\"><code>union</code></a>\n</li></ul>\n<table class=\"t-rev-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-rev t-since-cxx11\"><td>\n<ul><li> <a href=\"/w/cpp/identifier_with_special_meaning/final\"><code>final</code></a>\n</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span></td></tr>\n</table>\n<ul><li> <a href=\"/w/cpp/keyword/enum\"><code>enum</code></a>\n</li></ul>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Usage","id":"Usage"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"keyword","title":"C++ keywords"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"C++ keyword: struct","children":[{"label":"Usage"},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also"}]},"standards":["C++11"],"wordCount":111,"codeBlockCount":1}
